 f=next(csv.reader([line.decode('utf-8')]))
 if f[0]!='R01':continue
 count+=1;f[10]+=f'; Task9 Fix4 Rulings33-35/source{source[:8]}: exact17.11/Auth component capture and unchanged9df RED55000auth.uid before exact paired LF tuple only +440bytes SQL2fc84329; final hosted/modern/component61pass195assert 74/82/84refusals twoapplies allpreservation 70DB inputs fourgates0; private/defaults/ACL/native/scanner exact, production44 unchanged'
